[gotcha]
observed = "The embedded baseline verification request conflicts with the explicit implementation-first gate order, and a Node/npm runtime exercise conflicts with the no-external-binary Python gate contract. Broad initial ledger/source output exceeded the tool display limit; relevant task sections and sources were subsequently read separately. The predecessor 22.31.375 stores its evidence notes in its AssemblyScript test rather than matching Python repair paths."
handling = "Keep the declared gate unchanged and record runtime/baseline limits honestly. Record session observations here because GOTCHA.kvx and spec qualification files are outside the allowed scope; do not run additional gates, edit spec, commit or push."
